      ],
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Rang Undang-Undang Pinjaman (Tempatan) (Pindaan) 2005"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Pinjaman (Tempatan) (Pindaan) 2005."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini mula berkuat kuasa pada tarikh yang ditetapkan oleh Menteri melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta. Pindaan seksyen 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Pinjaman (Tempatan) 1959 [Akta 637], yang disebut \"Akta ibu\" dalam Akta ini, dipinda dalam seksyen A—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan nota bahu dengan nota bahu yang berikut: \"Sums charged on and payable out of Consolidated Fund\"; Rang Undang-Undang"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2), subseksyen yang berikut: \"(3) All expenditure in connection with the purchase, conversion and cancellation of stock made in accordance with this Act are charged upon and payable out of the Consolidated Fund.\". Pindaan seksyen 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 5 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2) Any sum raised under this Act may be applied— (a) for the repayment or amortization of loans raised under this Act or any other written law; or (b) where a loan is raised by the issue of stock under this Act or any other written law, for the purchase or conver- sion of such stock.\". Pindaan tajuk Bahagian IV"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan tajuk Bahagian IV dengan tajuk yang berikut: \"PART IV PROVISIONS RELATING TO REDEMPTION, PURCHASE, CONVERSION AND CANCELLATION OF STOCK AND CREATION OF SINKING FUND\". Pindaan seksyen 11"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 11 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \"11. (1) Stock issued under the provisions of this Act shall be redeemable at par— (a) on such dates as may be specified in the prospectus; or (b) where the prospectus provides that the stock is redeemable at the election of the Minister, on the earlier of the following dates: (i) the date of maturity; or (ii) the date of a call for redemption before maturity, to the extent to which such call is made, in accordance with the terms set out in the prospectus, after which dates all the interest on the principal moneys represented thereby shall cease and determine, whether payment of such principal moneys shall have been demanded or not. (2) Notwithstanding subsections 8A(5), 8B(4) and 11(1), where stock is redeemable at the election of the Minister and a call for redemption is made for only part of the stock, only such part of the stock as has been called for redemption shall be redeemable on the date of the call.\". Seksyen baru 11A dan 11B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 11 seksyen yang berikut: \"Power to purchase and cancel stock 11A. (1) The Bank may, with the approval of the Minister, purchase any stock, issued under section 6, held by any person subject to such price and such terms as may be allowed by the Minister. (2) The Bank may, with the approval of the Minister, cancel any stock purchased in accordance with subsection (1) upon such terms as may be allowed by the Minister. Power to convert stock 11B. (1) The Bank may, with the approval of the Minister, convert any stock or any part thereof, by exchanging such stock for any other stock, including new stock issued for the purposes of this section subject to such price and such terms as may be allowed by the Minister. (2) The Bank may, with the approval of the Minister, cancel any stock it has obtained under subsection (1) upon such terms as may be allowed by the Minister.\". Pindaan seksyen 13"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 13 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \"13. The sinking fund created under section 12 shall be applied— (a) firstly, for the payment of all expenses of, or incidental to, the management of the sinking fund and the redemption, purchase or conversion of the stock issued under this Act; (b) secondly, for the repayment of principal moneys represented by the stock; and (c) finally, for any purchase or conversion of stock under sections 11A and 11B.\". Pindaan seksyen 14"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 14 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"due\" perkataan \"or the purchase or conversion of stock under sections 11A and 11B\"."
      }
    }
  ]
}
